// MASTER COPY - this is the tracked one.  The build copies it to
// Run/Data/Patch.str, which is where the game reads it from and which is
// gitignored, so edit THIS file and rebuild (or copy it across by hand).
//
// Patch.str is the 1.04 string overlay from PatchData.big.  The two original
// strings are kept; everything after them is this fork's, and every command
// added to Data/INI/CommandMap.ini needs a pair here or Options > Keyboard
// shows a blank row.
//
// Comments are '//' - GameText.cpp parseStringFile skips exactly that.

GUI:CustomMission
"CUSTOM MISSION"
END

GUI:StartCustomMission
"START GAME"
END

GUI:SelectNextIdleWorker
"Select Next Idle Worker"
END

GUI:SelectNextIdleWorkerDescription
"Selects the next dozer or worker that has nothing to do and centers the view on it."
END

GUI:CommandSlot01
"Command Bar Slot 01"
END

GUI:CommandSlot01Description
"Presses command bar slot 01 (column 1, top row, 'Q' in the default grid layout)."
END

